span><span class="stldocs-type"><span class="stldocs-type-preview-prefix">object</span><span class="stldocs-type-preview" data-stldocs-type-preview="properties"><span class="stldocs-type-brace"> {</span><span class="stldocs-type-preview-content"> <span class="stldocs-type-propertyname"><span class="stldocs-text-identifier">mode</span></span> </span><span class="stldocs-type-brace">} </span></span></span></div><div class="stldocs-property-description"><div class="stldocs-markdown stldocs-content stl-ui-prose"><p>Marks the exact end of a reusable prompt prefix. The breakpoint inherits its TTL from the request’s <code>prompt_cache_options.ttl</code>; the boundary is not rounded to a token block.</p>
</div></div></div></div></summary><div class="stldocs-expander-content"><div class="stldocs-property-children"><div class="stldocs-properties"><div class="stldocs-property" data-stldocs-language="http"><div id="(resource) responses &gt; (model) response_input_file &gt; (schema) &gt; (property) prompt_cache_breakpoint &gt; (property) mode" class="stldocs-property-info"><div class="stldocs-property-declaration"><span class="stldocs-type-propertyname"><span class="stldocs-text-identifier">mode</span></span><span class="stldocs-text-punctuation">: </span><span class="stldocs-type"><span class="stldocs-type-preview" data-stldocs-type-preview="union"><span class="stldocs-type-preview-content"><span class="stldocs-type"><span class="stldocs-literal-string">&quot;explicit&quot;</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class="stldocs-property-description"><div class="stldocs-markdown stldocs-content stl-ui-prose"><p>The breakpoint mode. Always <code>explicit</code>.</p>
