an class="stldocs-type-preview-content"><span class="stldocs-type"><span class="stldocs-literal-string">&quot;eq&quot;</span></span><span class="stldocs-text-operator"> <!-- -->or<!-- --> </span><span class="stldocs-type"><span class="stldocs-literal-string">&quot;ne&quot;</span></span><span class="stldocs-text-operator"> <!-- -->or<!-- --> </span><span class="stldocs-type"><span class="stldocs-literal-string">&quot;gt&quot;</span></span><span class="stldocs-text-operator"> <!-- -->or<!-- --> </span><span class="stldocs-truncation">5<!-- --> more</span></span></span></span></div><div class="stldocs-property-description"><div class="stldocs-markdown stldocs-content stl-ui-prose"><p>Specifies the comparison operator: <code>eq</code>, <code>ne</code>, <code>gt</code>, <code>gte</code>, <code>lt</code>, <code>lte</code>, <code>in</code>, <code>nin</code>.</p>
<ul>
<li><code>eq</code>: equals</li>
<li><code>ne</code>: not equal</li>
<li><code>gt</code>: greater than</li>
<li><code>gte</code>: greater than or equal</li>
<li><code>lt</code>: less than</li>
<li><code>lte</code>: less than or equal</li>
<li><code>in</code>: in</li>
<li><code>nin</code>: not in</li>
</ul>
