iption"><div class="stldocs-markdown stldocs-content stl-ui-prose"><p>The approximate location of the user. If omitted or null, defaults to the United States. To avoid this fallback, pass <code>{"type": "approximate"}</code> without location fields. To localize results, provide the relevant location fields.</p>
</div></div></div></div></summary><div class="stldocs-expander-content"><div class="stldocs-property-children"><div class="stldocs-properties"><div class="stldocs-property" data-stldocs-language="http"><div id="(resource) responses.input_tokens &gt; (method) count &gt; (params) 0 &gt; (param) input &gt; (schema) &gt; (variant) 1 &gt; (items) &gt; (variant) 10 &gt; (property) tools &gt; (items) &gt; (variant) 14 &gt; (property) user_location &gt; (property) type" class="stldocs-property-info"><div class="stldocs-property-declaration"><span class="stldocs-type-propertyname"><span class="stldocs-text-identifier">type</span></span><span class="stldocs-text-punctuation">: </span><span class="stldocs-type"><span class="stldocs-type-preview" data-stldocs-type-preview="union"><span class="stldocs-type-preview-content"><span class="stldocs-type"><span class="stldocs-literal-string">&quot;approximate&quot;</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class="stldocs-property-description"><div class="stldocs-markdown stldocs-content stl-ui-prose"><p>The type of location approximation. Always <code>approximate</code>.</p>
