 &gt; (property) encrypted_content" class="stldocs-property-info"><div class="stldocs-property-declaration"><span class="stldocs-type-propertyname"><span class="stldocs-text-identifier">encrypted_content</span></span><span class="stldocs-text-punctuation">: </span><span class="stldocs-text-punctuation">optional </span><span class="stldocs-type"><span class="stldocs-type-preview" data-stldocs-type-preview="union"><span class="stldocs-type-preview-content"><span class="stldocs-type"><span class="stldocs-type-plain">string</span></span><span class="stldocs-text-operator"> <!-- -->or<!-- --> </span><span class="stldocs-type"><span class="stldocs-type-plain">null</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class="stldocs-property-description"><div class="stldocs-markdown stldocs-content stl-ui-prose"><p>The encrypted content of the reasoning item. This is populated by default
for reasoning items returned by <code>POST /v1/responses</code> and WebSocket
<code>response.create</code> requests.</p>
<p>When streaming, use the completed reasoning item and its
<code>encrypted_content</code> from the <code>response.output_item.done</code> event in
subsequent requests. The <code>encrypted_content</code> in
<code>response.output_item.added</code> may be incomplete. This is especially
important when <code>store</code> is <code>false</code> or when using Zero Data Retention.</p>
</div></div></div><a href="#(resource)%20responses.input_tokens%20%3E%20(method)%20count%20%3E%20(params)%200%20%3E%20(param)%20input%20%3E%20(schema)%20%3E%20(variant)%201%20%3E%20(items)%20%3E%20(variant)%2013%20%3E%20(property)%20encrypted_content" aria-label="Link to this property" class="stl-ui-button stl-ui-button--outline stl-ui-button--size-sm stl-ui-button--with-border not-content stl-ui-not-prose stldocs-deep-link-button"><span class="stl-ui-button__icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-link" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg></span></a></div><div class="stldocs-property" data-stldocs-language="http"><details class="stldocs-expander" data-stldocs-expander-muted="false"><summary class="stldocs-expander-summary"><div class="stldocs-expander-summary-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus stldocs-icon" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-minus stldocs-icon" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path></svg></div><div class="stldocs-expander-summary-content"><div id="(resource) responses.input_tokens &gt; (method) count &gt; (params) 0 &gt; (param) input &gt; (schema) &gt; (variant) 1 &gt; (items) &gt; (variant) 13 &gt; (property) status" class="stldocs-property-info"><div class="stldocs-property-declaration"><span class="stldocs-type-proper