xt-operator"> <!-- -->or<!-- --> </span><span class="stldocs-type"><span class="stldocs-type-plain">null</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class="stldocs-property-description"><div class="stldocs-markdown stldocs-content stl-ui-prose"><p>A system (or developer) message inserted into the model’s context.
