</ul>
</div></div></div></div></summary><div class="stldocs-expander-content"><div class="stldocs-property-children"><div class="stldocs-properties"><div class="stldocs-property" data-stldocs-language="http"><details class="stldocs-expander" data-stldocs-expander-muted="false"><summary class="stldocs-expander-summary"><div class="stldocs-expander-summary-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus stldocs-icon" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-minus stldocs-icon" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path></svg></div><div class="stldocs-expander-summary-content"><div id="(resource) responses.input_tokens &gt; (method) count &gt; (params) 0 &gt; (param) text &gt; (schema) &gt; (property) format" class="stldocs-property-info"><div class="stldocs-property-declaration"><span class="stldocs-type-propertyname"><span class="stldocs-text-identifier">format</span></span><span class="stldocs-text-punctuation">: </span><span class="stldocs-text-punctuation">optional </span><span class="stldocs-type"><span class="stldocs-type-reference"><a href="/api/reference/resources/responses#(resource)%20responses%20%3E%20(model)%20response_format_text_config%20%3E%20(schema)">ResponseFormatTextConfig</a></span></span></div><div class="stldocs-property-description"><div class="stldocs-markdown stldocs-content stl-ui-prose"><p>An object specifying the format that the model must output.</p>
<p>Configuring <code>{ "type": "json_schema" }</code> enables Structured Outputs,
which ensures the model will match your supplied JSON schema. Learn more in the
<a href="/api/docs/guides/structured-outputs">Structured Outputs guide</a>.</p>
<p>The default format is <code>{ "type": "text" }</code> with no additional options.</p>
<p><strong>Not recommended for gpt-4o and newer models:</strong></p>
<p>Setting to <code>{ "type": "json_object" }</code> enables the older JSON mode, which
ensures the message the model generates is valid JSON. Using <code>json_schema</code>
is preferred for models that support it.</p>
</div></div></div></div></summary><div class="stldocs-expander-content"><div class="stldocs-property-children"><div class="stldocs-property-annotation">One of the following:</div><div class="stldocs-properties"><div class="stldocs-property" data-stldocs-language="http"><details class="stldocs-expander" data-stldocs-expander-muted="false"><summary class="stldocs-expander-summary"><div class="stldocs-expander-summary-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus stldocs-icon" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-minus stldocs-icon" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path></svg></div><div class="stldocs-expander-summary-content"><div id="(resource) responses.input_tokens &gt; (method) count &gt; (params) 0 &gt; (param) text &gt; (schema) &gt; (property) format + (resource) $shared &gt; (model) response_format_text &gt; (schema)" class="stldocs-property-info"><div class="stldocs-property-declaration"><span class="stldocs-text-identifier">ResponseFormatText</span> <span class="stldocs-type"><span class="stldocs-type-preview-prefix">object</span><span class="stldocs-type-preview" data-stldocs-type-preview="properties"><span class="stldocs-type-brace"> {</span><span class="stldocs-type-preview-content"> <span class="stldocs-type-propertyname"><span class="stldocs-text-identifier">type</span></span> </span><span class="stldocs-type-brace">} </span></span></span></div><div class="stldocs-property-description"><div class="stldocs-markdown stldocs-content stl-ui-prose"><p>Default response format. Used to generate text responses.</p>
</div></div></div></div></summary><div class="stldocs-expander-content"><div class="stldocs-property-children"><div class="stldocs-properties"><div class="stldocs-property" data-stldocs-language="http"><div id="(resource) responses.input_tokens &gt; (method) count &gt; (params) 0 &gt; (param) text &gt; (schema) &gt; (property) format + (resource) $shared &gt; (model) response_format_text &gt; (schema) &gt; (property) type" class="stldocs-property-info"><div class="stldocs-property-declaration"><span class="stldocs-type-propertyname"><span class="stldocs-text-identifier">type</span></span><span class="stldocs-text-punctuation">: </span><span class="stldocs-type"><span class="stldocs-type-preview" data-stldocs-type-preview="union"><span class="stldocs-type-preview-content"><span class="stldocs-type"><span class="stldocs-literal-string">&quot;text&quot;</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class="stldocs-property-description"><div class="stldocs-markdown stldocs-content stl-ui-prose"><p>The type of response format being defined. Always <code>text</code>.</p>
</div></div></div><a href="#(resource)%20responses.input_tokens%20%3E%20(method)%20count%20%3E%20(params)%200%20%3E%20(param)%20text%20%3E%20(schema)%20%3E%20(property)%20format%20%2B%20(resource)%20%24shared%20%3E%20(model)%20response_format_text%20%3E%20(schema)%20%3E%20(property)%20type" aria-label="Link to this property" class="stl-ui-button stl-ui-button--outline stl-ui-button--size-sm stl-ui-button--with-border not-content stl-ui-not-prose stldocs-deep-link-button"><span class="stl-ui-button__icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-link" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg></span></a></div></div></div></div></details><a href="#(resource)%20responses.input_tokens%20%3E%20(method)%20count%20%3E%20(params)%200%20%3E%20(param)%20text%20%3E%20(schema)%20%3E%20(property)%20format%20%2B%20(resource)%20%24shared%20%3E%20(model)%20response_format_text%20%3E%20(schema)" aria-label="Link to this property" class="stl-ui-button stl-ui-button--outline stl-ui-button--size-sm stl-ui-button--with-border not-content stl-ui-not-prose stldocs-deep-link-button"><span class="stl-ui-button__icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-link" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg></span></a></div><div class="stldocs-property" data-stldocs-language="http"><details class="stldocs-expander" data-stldocs-expander-muted="false"><summary class="stldocs-expander-summary"><div class="stl