ns the tools available to the model to a pre-defined set.</p>
</div></div></div></div></summary><div class="stldocs-expander-content"><div class="stldocs-property-children"><div class="stldocs-properties"><div class="stldocs-property" data-stldocs-language="http"><details class="stldocs-expander" data-stldocs-expander-muted="false"><summary class="stldocs-expander-summary"><div class="stldocs-expander-summary-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus stldocs-icon" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-minus stldocs-icon" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path></svg></div><div class="stldocs-expander-summary-content"><div id="(resource) responses &gt; (model) tool_choice_allowed &gt; (schema) &gt; (property) mode" class="stldocs-property-info"><div class="stldocs-property-declaration"><span class="stldocs-type-propertyname"><span class="stldocs-text-identifier">mode</span></span><span class="stldocs-text-punctuation">: </span><span class="stldocs-type"><span class="stldocs-type-preview" data-stldocs-type-preview="union"><span class="stldocs-type-preview-content"><span class="stldocs-type"><span class="stldocs-literal-string">&quot;auto&quot;</span></span><span class="stldocs-text-operator"> <!-- -->or<!-- --> </span><span class="stldocs-type"><span class="stldocs-literal-string">&quot;required&quot;</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class="stldocs-property-description"><div class="stldocs-markdown stldocs-content stl-ui-prose"><p>Constrains the tools available to the model to a pre-defined set.</p>
<p><code>auto</code> allows the model to pick from among the allowed tools and generate a
message.</p>
<p><code>required</code> requires the model to call one or more of the allowed tools.</p>
</div></div></div></div></summary><div class="stldocs-expander-content"><div class="stldocs-property-children"><div class="stldocs-property-annotation">One of the following:</div><div class="stldocs-properties"><div class="stldocs-property" data-stldocs-language="http"><div id="(resource) responses &gt; (model) tool_choice_allowed &gt; (schema) &gt; (property) mode &gt; (member) 0" class="stldocs-property-info"><div class="stldocs-property-declaration"><span class="stldocs-type"><span class="stldocs-literal-string">&quot;auto&quot;</span></span></div></div><a href="#(resource)%20responses%20%3E%20(model)%20tool_choice_allowed%20%3E%20(schema)%20%3E%20(property)%20mode%20%3E%20(member)%200" aria-label="Link to this property" class="stl-ui-button stl-ui-button--outline stl-ui-button--size-sm stl-ui-button--with-border not-content stl-ui-not-prose stldocs-deep-link-button"><span class="stl-ui-button__icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-link" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg></span></a></div><div class="stldocs-property" data-stldocs-language="http"><div id="(resource) responses &gt; (model) tool_choice_allowed &gt; (schema) &gt; (property) mode &gt; (member) 1" class="stldocs-property-info"><div class="stldocs-property-declaration"><span class="stldocs-type"><span class="stldocs-literal-string">&quot;required&quot;</span></span></div></div><a href="#(resource)%20responses%20%3E%20(model)%20tool_choice_allowed%20%3E%20(schema)%20%3E%20(property)%20mode%20%3E%20(member)%201" aria-label="Link to this property" class="stl-ui-button stl-ui-button--outline stl-ui-button--size-sm stl-ui-button--with-border not-content stl-ui-not-prose stldocs-deep-link-button"><s