an class="stldocs-type-preview-content"><span class="stldocs-type"><span class="stldocs-literal-string">&quot;eq&quot;</span></span><span class="stldocs-text-operator"> <!-- -->or<!-- --> </span><span class="stldocs-type"><span class="stldocs-literal-string">&quot;ne&quot;</span></span><span class="stldocs-text-operator"> <!-- -->or<!-- --> </span><span class="stldocs-type"><span class="stldocs-literal-string">&quot;gt&quot;</span></span><span class="stldocs-text-operator"> <!-- -->or<!-- --> </span><span class="stldocs-truncation">5<!-- --> more</span></span></span></span></div><div class="stldocs-property-description"><div class="stldocs-markdown stldocs-content stl-ui-prose"><p>Specifies the comparison operator: <code>eq</code>, <code>ne</code>, <code>gt</code>, <code>gte</code>, <code>lt</code>, <code>lte</code>, <code>in</code>, <code>nin</code>.</p>
<ul>
<li><code>eq</code>: equals</li>
<li><code>ne</code>: not equal</li>
<li><code>gt</code>: greater than</li>
<li><code>gte</code>: greater than or equal</li>
<li><code>lt</code>: less than</li>
<li><code>lte</code>: less than or equal</li>
<li><code>in</code>: in</li>
<li><code>nin</code>: not in</li>
</ul>
</div></div></div></div></summary><div class="stldocs-expander-content"><div class="stldocs-property-children"><div class="stldocs-property-annotation">One of the following:</div><div class="stldocs-properties"><div class="stldocs-property" data-stldocs-language="http"><div id="(resource) $shared &gt; (model) comparison_filter &gt; (schema) &gt; (property) type &gt; (member) 0" class="stldocs-property-info"><div class="stldocs-property-declaration"><span class="stldocs-type"><span class="stldocs-literal-string">&quot;eq&quot;</span></span></div></div><a href="#(resource)%20%24shared%20%3E%20(model)%20comparison_filter%20%3E%20(schema)%20%3E%20(property)%20type%20%3E%20(member)%200" aria-label="Link to this property" class="stl-ui-button stl-ui-button--outline stl-ui-button--size-sm stl-ui-button--with-border not-content stl-ui-not-prose stldocs-deep-link-button"><span class="stl-ui-button__icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-link" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg></span></a></div><div class="stldocs-property" data-stldocs-language="http"><div id="(resource) $shared &gt; (model) comparison_filter &gt; (schema) &gt; (property) type &gt; (member) 1" class="stldocs-property-info"><div class="stldocs-property-declaration"><span class="stldocs-type"><span class="stldocs-literal-string">&quot;ne&quot;</span></span></div></div><a href="#(resource)%20%24shared%20%3E%20(model)%20comparison_filter%20%3E%20(schema)%20%3E%20(property)%20type%20%3E%20(member)%201" aria-label="Link to this property" class="stl-ui-button stl-ui-button--outline stl-ui-button--size-sm stl-ui-button--with-border not-content stl-ui-not-prose stldocs-deep-link-button"><span class="stl-ui-bu