de>. The requested size must also satisfy the model’s current pixel and edge limits. The standard sizes <code>1024x1024</code>, <code>1536x1024</code>, and <code>1024x1536</code> are supported by the GPT image models; <code>auto</code> is supported for models that allow automatic sizing.</p>
